From: Tommy <tommy@pham.cc>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 03:42:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 43/55] Perf counters: PS2X_PERF_STATS per-second EE busy, GS
 queue waits, GL worker, batches

[perf] line per second (off by default): EE thread busy time (wall minus the
scheduler's host pacing waits, now measured in every mode), GS packet time on
the EE thread, GS queue back-pressure and drain waits, GS worker busy time, GL
batches/draws/texture decodes, VU1/VIF1 host time (PS2X_PERF_STATS_VU=1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
